@host = http://localhost:5080

### 1. Crear cliente (copia el "id" de la respuesta)
POST {{host}}/api/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "María Fernanda López",
  "dateOfBirth": "1995-03-14",
  "gender": "Female",
  "monthlyIncome": 1500.50
}

### 2. Crear cuenta (pega el id del cliente)
POST {{host}}/api/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "PEGA-AQUI-EL-ID-DEL-CLIENTE",
  "initialBalance": 100
}

### 3. Consultar saldo (reemplaza el número de cuenta)
GET {{host}}/api/accounts/ACC-20261105-0000/balance

### 4. Depositar
POST {{host}}/api/accounts/ACC-20261105-0000/deposits
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 50.25 }

### 5. Retirar
POST {{host}}/api/accounts/ACC-20261105-0000/withdrawals
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 20 }

### 6. Retiro sin fondos -> 400 con cuerpo JSON limpio
POST {{host}}/api/accounts/ACC-20261105-0000/withdrawals
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 999999 }

### 7. Historial
GET {{host}}/api/accounts/ACC-20261105-0000/transactions

### 8. Cuenta inexistente -> 404
GET {{host}}/api/accounts/ACC-00000000-0000/balance
